[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Expandable Content
[/meta]

h1. Expandable Content

Tests for Section 13 of the specification.

h2. Basics

h3. Expandable block {#more-basic}
[code om]
[more Click to expand]
Hidden content revealed on click.
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Click to expand</summary>
<p>Hidden content revealed on click.</p>
</details>
[/code]

h3. The title is required {#more-without-title}
[code om]
[more]
Content.
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
more-without-title 1
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting in the title {#more-title-formatting}
[code om]
[more *Bold* title]
Text.
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary><strong>Bold</strong> title</summary>
<p>Text.</p>
</details>
[/code]

h3. A link in the title is reduced to its text {#more-title-link}
[code om]
[more See [the docs]:https://example.com]
Text.
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>See the docs</summary>
<p>Text.</p>
</details>
[/code]

h3. Empty expandable block {#more-empty}
[code om]
[more Title]
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Title</summary>
</details>
[/code]

h2. Content

h3. Headings and lists are allowed {#more-heading-list}
[code om]
[more Details here]
h3. Inside

* a
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Details here</summary>
<h3 id="inside">Inside</h3>
<ul>
<li>a</li>
</ul>
</details>
[/code]

h3. Tables are allowed {#more-table}
[code om]
[more Data]
|| A ||
| 1 |
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Data</summary>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th scope="col">A</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</details>
[/code]

h3. Nested expandable blocks are allowed {#more-nested}
[code om]
[more Outer]
[more Inner]
Text.
[/more]
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Outer</summary>
<details>
<summary>Inner</summary>
<p>Text.</p>
</details>
</details>
[/code]

h3. Notes are allowed {#more-note}
[code om]
[more Outer]
[note]
Text.
[/note]
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Outer</summary>
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
</details>
[/code]

h3. A table of contents is not allowed {#more-toc}
[code om]
[more Outer]
[toc]
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. A footnote block is not allowed {#more-fn}
[code om]
[more Outer]
[fn]
1. Note.
[/fn]
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Not allowed in the basic profile {#more-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[more Title]
Text.
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]
